    {
      "id": "nl-cap-r2-q2",
      "round": 2,
      "type": "numeric",
      "prompt": "At that bias (\\(V=-2\\ \\mathrm{V}\\), \\(C=0.668\\ \\mathrm{pF}\\)), a small signal \\(v=10\\ \\mathrm{mV}\\) is superimposed. How much small-signal charge \\(q\\) flows, in fC?",
      "answer": 6.68153,
